s="mt-3 block max-w-[15rem] text-[15px] leading-snug text-muted-foreground">About your height, so it reaches what you reach</span></dd></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 border-b border-border py-7 pr-4 odd:border-r odd:pr-6 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:px-8 lg:first:pl-0 lg:last:border-r-0" style="transition-delay:90ms"><dt class="sr-only">Light enough for upstairs floors and rugs</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-heading text-[clamp(3rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tracking-tight text-foreground">32</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground">kg</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block max-w-[15rem] text-[15px] leading-snug text-muted-foreground">Light enough for upstairs floors and rugs</span></dd></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 border-b border-border py-7 pr-4 odd:border-r odd:pr-6 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:px-8 lg:first:pl-0 lg:last:border-r-0" style="transition-delay:180ms"><dt class="sr-only">Of work per charge, then it docks itself</dt><dd><span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5"><span class="font-heading text-[clamp(3rem,5vw,4.5rem)] leading-none tracking-tight text-foreground">4</span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground">h</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 block max-w-[15rem] text-[15px] leading-snug text-muted-foreground">Of work per charge, then it docks itself</span></dd></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 border-b border-border py-7 pr-4 odd:border-r odd:pr-6 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r lg:px-8 lg:first:pl-0 lg:last:bo